<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel='stylesheet' href='/stylesheets/style.css' />
</head>
<body>
<h1><%= title %></h1>
<p>Welcome to <%= title %>.   Let's test reading get+post data</p>

<br/><br/>
<b>New Customer Form </b> to test POST request and reading data using URI  /readNameAndRespond
<br/>
<form action="/readCustomerInfoAndRespond" method="post">

  Name: <input type="text" name="name"> </input>
  <br/>
  Email: <input type="text" name="email"> </input>
  <br/>
  <input type="submit" value="Go"/>
</form>

<br><br><br>
<hr>

<b>Form to test GET request</b> and reading the data using URI /readNameAndRespond
<br/>
<form action="/readNameAndRespond" method="get">

  Name: <input type="text" name="name"> </input>
  <br/>
  <input type="submit" value="Go"/>
</form>
<br><br><br>
<hr>
<b>Form to test POST request</b> and reading data using URI  /readNameAndRespond
<br/>
<form action="/readNameAndRespond" method="post">

  Name: <input type="text" name="name"> </input>
  <br/>
  <input type="submit" value="Go"/>
</form>




<hr>
<section aria-labelledby="fetch-heading">
  <h2 id="fetch-heading">Lab 8.2 — JavaScript Fetch Demo</h2>
  <p>These forms send GET and POST requests with JavaScript fetch(), without leaving this page.</p>

  <form id="fetch-get-form">
    <label>GET name: <input name="name" required></label>
    <button type="submit">Send GET with fetch</button>
  </form>

  <form id="fetch-post-form">
    <label>POST name: <input name="name" required></label>
    <button type="submit">Send POST with fetch</button>
  </form>

  <form id="fetch-customer-form">
    <label>Customer name: <input name="name" required></label>
    <label>Email: <input name="email" type="email" required></label>
    <button type="submit">Send customer POST with fetch</button>
  </form>

  <p><strong>Server response:</strong></p>
  <pre id="fetch-result" role="status" aria-live="polite">Submit a fetch form to see the response here.</pre>
</section>
<script src="/javascripts/fetch-demo.js" defer></script>

</body>
</html>
